        "char_end": 725,
        "char_start": 613,
        "effective_step": 4,
        "end_token_index": 259,
        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 260,
        "step_number": 4,
        "text": "Step 4: Testing \\(x = 1\\):\n\\[1^4 + 5(1)^3 + 9(1)^2 - 1 - 14 = 1 + 5 + 9 - 1 - 14 = 0.\\]\nSo, \\(x = 1\\) is a root."
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 860,
        "boundary_aligned_back": true,
        "char_end": 861,
        "char_start": 727,
        "effective_step": 5,
        "end_token_index": 337,
        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 338,
        "step_number": 5,
        "text": "Step 5: Testing \\(x = -1\\):\n\\[(-1)^4 + 5(-1)^3 + 9(-1)^2 - (-1) - 14 = 1 - 5 + 9 + 1 - 14 = -8 \\neq 0.\\]\nSo, \\(x = -1\\) is not a root."
